      "description": "## Overview\n[bigint-buffer](https://www.npmjs.com/package/bigint-buffer) is a Node utility that converts TC39 Proposed BigInts to and from buffers\n\nAffected versions of this package are vulnerable to Buffer Overflow in the `toBigIntLE()` function. Attackers can exploit this to crash the application.\n## PoC\n```js\r\nlet be = require('bigint-buffer');\r\nconsole.log(be.toBigIntLE(null));\r\n```\n## Remediation\nThere is no fixed version for `bigint-buffer`.\n## References\n- [Native Node Extension Risks](https://www.usenix.org/system/files/sec23fall-prepub-262_staicu.pdf)\n- [Vulnerable Code](https://github.com/no2chem/bigint-buffer/blob/master/src/index.ts#L25)\n",
